<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (In addition to prediction, a major focus of the project is interpretability. Rather than treating the model as a black box, we aim to build an interpretability layer that can trace a predicted side effect back to the factors that may have contributed to it. These factors could be chemical, such as specific atoms, substructures, or functional groups, or biological, such as proteins, pathways, and interaction networks. The objective is not only to predict that an interaction may occur, but also to provide insight into why it may occur.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
