/P 114 0 R
/E (The SMILES \(Simplified Molecular Input Line Entry System\) representation describes a molecule using a sequence of characters. This allows transformer models to learn directly from the drug's structure and identify important chemical features such as atoms, substructures, and functional groups.)
/Pg 16 0 R
