222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Another way to represent a drug is through its biological interactions. Drugs interact with proteins, proteins interact with other proteins, and together they form complex biological networks. Graph Neural Networks can learn from these relationships and capture how a drug behaves inside the body.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
