381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (As a preparatory task for the proposed Drug-Drug Interaction \(DDI\) prediction project, the core Transformer architecture from the paper Attention Is All You Need was implemented from scratch using PyTorch.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The implementation included Multi-Head Attention, Positional Encoding, Feed Forward Networks, Encoder and Decoder layers, and the complete Transformer model. A simplified version of the architecture was trained on an English-German translation dataset to verify that the model was functioning correctly. The decreasing training loss across epochs confirmed successful learning.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (This exercise helped build a practical understanding of the Transformer architecture, which serves as the foundation for many modern deep learning models, including those used in biomedical applications such as DDI prediction.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
